; Travelling glow — ProximityLighting auto-dims this against the player's
; LoS / distance just like every other light in the level. No shadows since
; a fast-moving point light updating shadow maps every frame is expensive
; and self-shadowing on the projectile mesh looks wrong.
[node name="Glow" type="OmniLight3D" parent="."]
